The result is not yet shippable: every OpenRouter call returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” leaving G9 unrun and `all_passed: false`. The transcripts record those errors honestly; no hardness verdict was fabricated. Restore the OpenRouter account allowance and rerun:

