The corrected family now passes local G1–G8 with the honest prior: \(1009^3=1{,}027{,}243{,}729\) structure-aware candidates, 0/200,000 sampled hits, four attacks at 0/8, and the reference algorithm still solves 8/8 as Track B requires. The compact affine route is 213 exact operations, under the 300-operation cap. I’m doing an independent full convex-hull containment cross-check next, because the fast checker must remain genuinely geometric after the three-cycle change.
