codex
Implemented a Track B, paper-licensed convex-polygon covering generator based on Section 5.1/Theorem 1.9 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1504.05476).

Local verification passes:

- G1–G8 and gated G9(c) all pass.
- 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses.
- Five attacks fail across 8 seeds.
- Exact containment agrees with materialized convex hulls on 154,980/154,980 checks.
- Reference route: 19,596 operations.
- Compact route: 108 arithmetic operations plus 54 ternary digit reversals.

Artifacts:

- [gen_1504_05476.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/gen_1504_05476.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1504.05476/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

