| easy | 729 | 18 | 55,868 chars | provisional `SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY` |
| medium | 2,187 | 18 | 187,846 chars | untested by oracle |
| hard | 6,561 | 18 | 598,355 chars | untested by oracle |

